  dialogueTextEn: 'Use <color=#FFD700><b>WASD</b></color> to walk around.

    Hold
    <color=#FFD700><b>Shift</b></color> to sprint, and press <color=#FFD700><b>Space</b></color>
    to roll away. You can''t be hit while rolling.'
